<title>CANADA: Morgan says more than one suitor interested.</title>
<headline>Morgan says more than one suitor interested.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Hydrocarbons Inc has received approaches from more than one potential suitor, Morgan president Bill Trickett said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>But in an interview, Trickett declined to name the firms that might float a takeover bid and when.</p>
<p>&quot;What we want to do is for the market to understand where the company is at this point,&quot; Tricket said regarding the company's announcement on Wednesday that it had received expressions of interest, formed a special committee and hired a financial adviser.</p>
</text>
